1
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:36,960
You don't remember me.

2
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,400
I am Zhaohan.

3
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:39,900
I am

4
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,400
your husband.

5
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,930
What nonsense are you talking about?

6
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:47,590
Since when do I have a husband?

7
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:49,430
It's okay if you don't remember.

8
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:50,700
I'll help you recall.

9
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:52,390
In those years,

10
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:55,100
I shielded you from seven heavenly tribulations,

11
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:58,230
and accompanied you from a low-ranking immortal to the God of War.

12
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:58,860
You said

13
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:00,490
as long as I'm here,

14
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,600
you fear nothing.

15
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,200
What is this?

16
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:07,490
Why have I never seen it before?

17
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:09,160
My head hurts so much.

18
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,260
Why am I crying?

19
00:01:13,030 --> 00:01:15,289
Because you've remembered everything.

20
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:16,460
You remember me.

21
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:20,530
You remember saying you'd only trust me in this life.

22
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:21,600
Li'er.

23
00:01:22,860 --> 00:01:23,700
Come back.

24
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:28,830
You have me in your heart.

25
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:30,200
You just forgot.

26
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:32,390
Come with me, Li'er.

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,120
I'll take you home.

28
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:41,030
My wife.

29
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,200
You just said

30
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:49,120
you are my husband.

31
00:01:50,060 --> 00:01:50,560
Yes.

32
00:01:51,259 --> 00:01:52,860
Do you know when I put on

33
00:01:53,060 --> 00:01:54,600
this hairpin on my head?

34
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:03,630
That is our token of love.

35
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:07,700
This wooden hairpin was made for me by someone who cares.

36
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:09,030
That person is not you.

37
00:02:27,930 --> 00:02:29,130
I was almost fooled.

38
00:02:30,060 --> 00:02:31,120
Congratulations,

39
00:02:31,260 --> 00:02:34,390
you have unlocked the seal of your sea of consciousness.

40
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:41,960
Now that the seal of your sea of consciousness is open,

41
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,600
if you want to know everything,

42
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,900
just jump down.

43
00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:50,100
But I must remind you,

44
00:02:50,530 --> 00:02:51,630
for hundreds of years,

45
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:54,760
I have never seen anyone with a sealed sea of consciousness.

46
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,300
Presumably, in your sea of consciousness,

47
00:02:56,300 --> 00:02:59,030
there must be things beyond ordinary endurance.

48
00:02:59,530 --> 00:03:01,060
Since you intend to open it,

49
00:03:01,230 --> 00:03:03,960
you must be prepared to bear the cost of the truth.

50
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:08,300
Have you thought it through?

51
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:26,560
My wife.

52
00:03:26,730 --> 00:03:27,700
I'll go with you.

53
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,060
I have thought it through.

54
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,760
It's finally over.

55
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:56,090
Thank you, Granny Liao.

56
00:04:03,730 --> 00:04:04,530
Granny.

57
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:09,960
I have thought it through.

58
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,730
Since everything is in the past,

59
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:13,530
I should cherish the people in front of me,

60
00:04:13,530 --> 00:04:15,130
and live a good life from now on.

61
00:04:15,130 --> 00:04:16,190
Thank you, Granny.

62
00:04:16,230 --> 00:04:17,029
I understand.

63
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:27,190
What's going on?

64
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:30,700
That fluctuation of spiritual power just now.

65
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,400
Your Majesty.

66
00:04:40,930 --> 00:04:42,260
Outside the South Heaven Gate, we caught an

67
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:44,030
unusually strong aura of spiritual power.

68
00:04:44,030 --> 00:04:46,130
It shot up into the sky from the direction of the mortal realm,

69
00:04:46,130 --> 00:04:47,430
and when it touched the Heavenly Court's barrier,

70
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:48,760
it didn't weaken at all.

71
00:04:58,900 --> 00:04:59,700
Investigate.

72
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,060
Follow that aura,

73
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:02,430
and find out for me

74
00:05:03,130 --> 00:05:04,430
whose power it is.

75
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:18,260
So hungry.

76
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,230
Your bun.
